 "readme": "## left-pad\n\nString left pad\n\n[![Build Status][travis-image]][travis-url]\n\n## Install\n\n```bash\n$ npm install left-pad\n```\n\n## Usage\n\n```js\nconst leftPad = require('left-pad')\n\nleftPad('foo', 5)\n// => \"  foo\"\n\nleftPad('foobar', 6)\n// => \"foobar\"\n\nleftPad(1, 2, '0')\n// => \"01\"\n\nleftPad(17, 5, 0)\n// =>",
